  "title": "Ma Su Is Executed; Zhou Fang Cuts Off His Hair",
  "year": "228",
  "summary": [
    "Zhuge Liang executes Ma Su, who was his closest friend's brother and the best young mind in Shu, and weeps doing it — then demotes himself three ranks for having appointed him against advice.",
    "In the east, Zhou Fang of Wu offers to defect and cuts off his own hair in front of Wei's envoys to prove his sincerity, which for a man of his time is very nearly self-mutilation. Cao Xiu believes him and marches into Shiting with a hundred thousand men."
  ],
